<wpt lat="37.937404" lon="-107.811759"><name>Coffee: Telluride</name><desc>Mile 0. The Butcher &amp; The Baker, 201 E Colorado; Baked in Telluride, 127 S Fir. Hours not confirmed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.946745" lon="-107.836350"><name>Fuel: Shell</name><desc>Mile 1.5. Conoco at mile 3.7.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.690298" lon="-108.031414"><name>Coffee: Rico</name><desc>Mile 27.8. Rico Coffee, 134 S Glasgow, 7 to 1 in most listings, 715-606-4778. Backup: Fireweed, 21 S Glasgow (listings disagree on whether it's open).</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.687830" lon="-108.031618"><name>Fuel: Mountain Top, Rico</name><desc>Mile 28. 235 S Glasgow, 970-967-4000, about 9 to 7. Grades not known.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.473461" lon="-108.502382"><name>Fuel: Dolores. LAST FOR 69 MILES</name><desc>Mile 64.4. 79 miles if Beaver Park is closed.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.473156" lon="-108.504258"><name>Lunch: Dolores (right on 4th, right on Central)</name><desc>Mile 64.5. The Depot, 520 Railroad, burgers, Tue-Sat 10:30 to 7:30, maybe cash only, 970-882-7500; Lindo Michoacan, 104 S 2nd, Mexican; Kelly's Kitchen, 315 Central (hours not confirmed). Bakery: Mama Bear's, 105 N 5th, to 2, closed Wed-Thu, 970-676-0031.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.762394" lon="-108.362987"><name>Way out: DECIDE: right onto CR H</name><desc>Mile 90.5. Beaver Park closed? Do NOT turn. Stay on the Dolores-Norwood Road; see Ways out.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.842458" lon="-108.179563"><name>Closed: Washout: Beaver Park Road</name><desc>Mile 107.9. Closed through June 30, 2027. Barricades.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.994003" lon="-108.021389"><name>Way out: Right onto CO 145</name><desc>Mile 132.2. Pavement to the end.</desc></wpt>
<wpt lat="37.994551" lon="-108.002038"><name>Fuel: Sawpit Mercantile</name><desc>Mile 133.3. Food too.</desc></wpt>
